# Chasing Shadows (crystalWar 60) at Rholont beside In a Haze of Glory (a Lua quest, available once Perils of the
# Griffon is completed: a GM; its Rholont reply is the Event 637) and Claws of the Griffon (accepted, Prog 1, Option 1:
# its Rholont reply the Event 49). A level 99 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria [S] with Blood of Heroes completed (a GM;
# the WotG mission The Scent of Battle current, which answers none of this). Available: Rholont's 656 (an Event) ties
# 637: container order the first time, the rotation the second. Accepted (a GM), Perils set back to available so In a
# Haze of Glory is gone: Rholont's 167 (an Event) ties Claws' 49 the same way.
lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rholont/onTrigger
char zone=SouthernSanDoriaS pos=-167.043,-2,55.484 job=WAR lvl=99
quest CrystalWar.BloodOfHeroes completed
quest CrystalWar.PerilsOfTheGriffon completed # In a Haze of Glory available: Rholont 637 (an Event)
mission Wotg TheScentOfBattle current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Rholont                         # Chasing's 656 and In a Haze of Glory's 637 tie: container order
finish-if-event
trigger Rholont                         # the second tie plays the other
finish-if-event
quest CrystalWar.ChasingShadows available # a GM
quest CrystalWar.ChasingShadows accepted # a GM
quest CrystalWar.PerilsOfTheGriffon available # a GM: In a Haze of Glory is gone
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon available # a GM
quest CrystalWar.ClawsOfTheGriffon accepted # a GM
charvar Quest[7][16]Prog 1              # a GM
charvar Quest[7][16]Option 1            # a GM
trigger Rholont                         # Chasing's 167 and Claws' 49 tie: container order
finish-if-event
trigger Rholont                         # the second tie plays the other
finish-if-event
